# Session Memory Boundary

Cursor adapter only. Project policy lives in root `AGENTS.md` and `knowledge/INDEX.md`.

Persistent project memory remains only:

- `knowledge/memory/OPERATOR_DECISIONS.md`
- `knowledge/memory/BACKLOG.md`
- `knowledge/memory/ACTIVE_WORKSPACE.md`
- `knowledge/memory/LAST_SESSION.md`

- `knowledge/memory/engrams/` — generated session-closeout artifacts; not canonical memory (do not treat as SoT).

Use the manual session scripts only when the operator explicitly starts or ends a session boundary task.

- Do not create shadow memory, transcript stores or repo-local memory banks.
- Do not mirror `LAST_SESSION.md` outside `knowledge/memory/`.
- When continuity matters, follow the cold-start route from `knowledge/INDEX.md`.
